  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "We'd like to welcome you to our Periwinkle home, Beach Blessings, located just steps from the beach, on the south side of 30A, and with a private pool. This home is pet-friendly! Located just a few minutes from Seaside and just a half-mile east of Highway 395. This spacious 5 bed, 4.5 bath 4,077 square foot multi-level home also has a spectacular fourth floor, beach-view sun deck overlooking our amazing 30A sunsets. This is a real gem you'll use every day of your vacation. <br><br>** Beach Chair Service Included For The 2026 Season (Mar-Oct)! 2 Chairs & An Umbrella!<br>** Beach towels included with every rental! <br><br>For those of you that have stayed with us in year's past, this home underwent an extensive remodel in 2020 and 2021. The pool deck is completely new along with the fencing around the yard. If you've stayed in this home before, you'll barely recognize the place! This is a gorgeous home in a location second to none - literally steps from the beach, minutes from Seaside, has a private pool, fenced-in area perfect for your family dog, and located on the south side of 30A (no street to cross to get to the beach). <br><br>On the ground floor, you’ll find the dedicated laundry room, a twin over twin bunk bed, a queen bedroom with 2 bunk beds with a twin bed over a queen bed, and a king master suite. Up the stairs, you enter the main living area featuring custom and colorful artwork, the grand and gorgeous all-stainless kitchen, a large double pantry, a huge dining table with seating for 8, an entire wall of window seating, a cozy coastal-inspired living area with a very large flat-screen TV, and decorative fireplace. Venture up to the third floor where you’ll discover a loft area with custom Twin bunks for 2. There is an additional King Master Suite and another great guest room featuring 2 bunk beds with a twin over a queen. The owner of this property spared no expense in adding an additional floor to this beautiful home! The fourth floor offers a large deck with FULL views of the ocean! <br><br>Dog-Friendly! (additional fees will be applied at booking)<br>**Maximum of two dogs<br>**No cats or other animals are allowed. Dogs must be under the 50lbs weight limit. ALL rules must be followed regarding your pets or a fine will occur.<br><br>We do weekly pool maintenance, but cannot control weather or debris. While we strive for cleanliness, we can't guarantee a debris-free pool. Rest assured, we're dedicated to keeping the pool in top condition.<br><br>**Elevator in the home is NOT for guest use.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 21 COMFORTABLY)<br><br>1st FLOOR:<br>• Master Bedroom: King Bed, Shower-Tub Combo, Private Access to Patio and Pool<br>• Family Style Bedroom: 2 Twin over Queen Bunk Beds, Walk-In Shower, Private Access to Patio and Pool<br>• Bunk Room: Twin over Twin Bunk Bed<br><br>2nd FLOOR:<br>• Living Area <br>• Expansive Galley Style Kitchen <br><br>3rd FLOOR:<br>• Master Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom, Private Porch <br>• Guest Bedroom: 2 Twin over Queen Bunk Beds, Private Full Bath, Porch Access<br>• Loft: 1 Twin over Twin Bunk Bed with Extra Twin Bed<br><br>4th FLOOR:<br>• The ROOFTOP DECK features a 180-degree view of the gorgeous white sandy beach and plenty of seating to entertain. <br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>• Beach Access: Less than 100 steps to the sand! Access the beach via private property!<br>• Private Pool with Cooling Spa (Heating not available)<br>• Gulf Views from the many picturesque porches<br>• Multiple Outdoor Showers<br>•NEW Gas BBQ Grill",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Stunning 30A Home SOUTH of 30A, Steps 2 Beach, PRIVATE POOL & Bch Chair Setup"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
