            "date": "Feb 2, 2026",
            "id": "bd192608-11d9-4ff1-963c-0ecd8ddac2ee",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you so much for this wonderful review! We’re thrilled to hear that your group had such an amazing time and that the home was the perfect place to bring everyone together. It means a lot to us that you chose Hilton Head—and this home—for such a special milestone spring break.\n\nWe’re especially happy to know the outdoor spaces worked so well for both the kids and chaperones, and that the trip lived up to (and exceeded!) expectations. On behalf of the owners and everyone at Blue Swell, thank you for trusting us with such a memorable chapter. It was truly our pleasure hosting you, and we hope to welcome you back again in the future!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was very satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nOur girls had the most enjoyable time! We had contemplated a cruise as well as vacationing in Hilton Head; but our love for this area, could not convince us of spending the last of (6) spring breaks with our core group ANYWHERE else. And, this home, this trip was ALL we anticipated and so much more. We became central station for many other friend groups staying nearby due to how this property could easily entertain outdoors these amazing kids and chaperones. Thank you, owners - THANK YOU Blue Swell for closing out a chapter in flying colors. It truly was a pleasure!",
        "title": "Last Senior Spring Break Hoorah"
      },
      {
